      "en": "“Even today my complaint is rebellious. His hand is heavy in spite of my groaning.",
      "ko": "내가 오늘도 혹독히 원망하니 받는 재앙이 탄식보다 중함이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "09939a47b9fc3e5414ba283c410293e8a03c15b022741c9bb545ab51e6153a58",
      "translation_text_hash": "4aa964b8aaaf933b0c08d57afd38523ff25adfdc6185a05b0028a56723a5d426",
