      "en": "I would set my cause in order before him, and fill my mouth with arguments.",
      "ko": "그 앞에서 호소하며 변백할 말을 입에 채우고",
      "source_text_hash": "d3e0f0b8a8c6427f95be38b5351f3faefddc61c3fcabe9a5a0b2f6cee20bc31e",
      "translation_text_hash": "095504baf4b1480abd06678ba390e7880b2da603a677e835bed0d4750e0f4b25",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
